### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "onboardingData": {
    "pregnancy_status": "pregnant",
    "last_period": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
    "cycle_length": 28,
    "period_length": 5,
    "pregnancy_week": 12,
    "pregnancy_progress": "first_trimester",
    "health_goals": "stay_healthy",
    "notifications": true
  }
}

### Verify email (you'll need to get the verification code from the email)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "verify_code": "123456"
}

### Login - Get Access Token and Refresh Token
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Refresh Access Token using Refresh Token
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "your_refresh_token_here"
}

### Logout (requires JWT token)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "refreshToken": "your_refresh_token_here"
}

### Logout from all devices (requires JWT token)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/logout-all
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### Test protected route with JWT token
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here
